## 5. Multi-Person Collaboration Model

### Serial Collaboration (Simplified)

```
COLLABORATION MODEL v1 (Serial, No Conflict Resolution)

  ┌─────────┐     ┌─────────┐     ┌─────────┐
  │ User A  │ ──→ │ User B  │ ──→ │ User C  │
  │ (active)│     │ (waits) │     │ (waits) │
  └─────────┘     └─────────┘     └─────────┘
       │
       ▼
  ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
  │         SHARED SPEC GRAPH            │
  │                                      │
  │  Single source of truth.             │
  │  One writer at a time.               │
  │  All others see real-time updates.   │
  │  Turn-based or lock-based access.    │
  └──────────────────────────────────────┘

  WHAT EACH USER SEES:
  • Full graph (collapsed into families by default)
  • Nodes authored by others are visible but read-only
  • Nodes they authored are editable
  • Conflicts between their nodes and others' are highlighted
  • Each node shows author attribution
```

