CONFLICT RESOLUTION SUGGESTIONS
================================

❌ Conflict: F3 ↔ F7
   F3: "Reset token expires in 15 minutes"
   F7: "Reset token valid for 24 hours"
   Reason: Contradictory TTL values.

   Option A: Keep 15 minutes (security-first)
     → Remove F7
     → Rationale: OWASP recommends short-lived tokens.
     → Impact: Users must check email quickly.

   Option B: Change to 24 hours (UX-first)
     → Update F3 to 24 hours
     → ⚠️ May conflict with B2 (OWASP compliance)
     → Impact: Weaker security posture.

   Option C: Tiered approach
     → Update F3: "Default 15min, configurable up to 24hr
       based on account security tier"
     → Add new node F8: "Premium accounts get extended
       token validity"
     → Impact: More complex but balances both concerns.

Type your resolution as a new spec, then press Enter
to re-compile.
================================

### Rules
- Present options neutrally
- Always note trade-offs
- Always note impact on other nodes
- Do NOT auto-apply any resolution
- Wait for user to type their chosen resolution as spec text


